Z||000000||My7Fieros||09-05-2001||12:15 AM||||Wow, what a trip. My roommate (3FASTBACK GT'S) and I left Friday to go to Chicago....went to Archies Saturday. Had a GREAT time! Met Oreif and Haze Performance there, then went over to Oreif's house...heres some pics of us at Archies....<BR>Me and one of Archies kits....<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-050s.jpg">   <BR>We all know this car! Archies daily driver<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-033s_5.jpg">   <BR>Archies latest project..oh my God is that thing loud! Left to right is Archie, Nick (3 FASTBACK GT'S), Haze Performance, and Oreif<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-043s.jpg">   <BR>This is what powers the above car...<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-053s.jpg">   <BR>Following Haze and Orief (in Hazes Indy) to Oreifs house...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-055s.jpg">   <BR>Ive gotta say I couldve stayed at Archies all day long, but I would've driven him nuts Im sure lol.<BR>Hazes Indy is beautiful, and Oreifs SE is mint! Thanks guys, had fun!<P><BR>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I><P>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 09-05-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 09-05-2001).]||||reg||7
