Z||000003||Haze_Performance||09-05-2001||01:09 AM||||<FONT SIZE="3"><B><u><FONT COLOR="red">MORE PICS!!!! MORE PICS!!!!</FONT></B></u></FONT> lol  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><BR>It was great meeting you guys to.. I think I can live in that drag car.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> My god sounded good!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">             <BR></A><BR><A HREF="http://www.clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero Club</A>||||reg||10
Z||000004||Oreif||09-05-2001||01:40 AM||||It was great meeting you guys. Maybe next year we could plan it around Fierorama and see your cars. Who knows maybe we could head on down there. Anyway, Glad you had a good trip.<P>So is Nick over his "Finale Blast" that he took with Archie?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Archie also said he's going to try and get the drag car ready for Fierorama so others can hear how awesome this car sounds!<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">     <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 09-05-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000005||My7Fieros||09-05-2001||02:56 AM||||<B>MORE...</B> Haze's Indy, man is that thing sweet!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-035s_1.jpg"> <BR>Front of Archie's...you can see his two kit cars...(yes we drove the Mustang, the Fiero doesnt have enough luggage space)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-041s_1.jpg"> <BR>Another V8...this one is a T-Top SE...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-044s.jpg"> <BR>A V8 Fiero getting doctored....I need a lift like this at home!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-047s.jpg"> <BR>Here we are at Oreif's house...and of course, his sweet SE (drool)...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-030s_2.jpg"> <BR>Haze/Oreif/Archie...Im comming back to Chicago <B>soon!</B>...we gotta meet again, and next time I'll bring a Fiero!<P><P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||7
